   <narrative xml:lang="FR">SIDS-  Indian Ocean ISLANDS --UNDP-COM-00122630</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="FR">The Project in Comoros is Part of the Indian Ocean Regional Project which will be implemented by UNDP in four Small Islands Developing States (SIDS): Union of Comoros, Maldives, Mauritius, and Seychelles. It aims not only to ban and limit imports of products containing POP and mercury? but also to strengthen technical and institutional capacities for the management of hazardous chemical and hospital waste.</narrative>
  </description>
